  <!-- EN: Project Z originally grants a 10% rank-5 stun-baton instant-kill chance; the modpack balance value is 1%.
RU: В Project Z исходный шанс мгновенного убийства электродубинкой на 5-м ранге равен 10%; баланс модпака использует 1%.-->
  <set xpath="/progression/perks/perk[@name='perkIntellectMastery']/effect_group[requirement[@name='ProgressionLevel' and @progression_name='perkIntellectMastery' and @operation='Equals' and @value='5'] and requirement[@name='HoldingItemHasTags' and contains(concat(',',@tags,','),',stunBaton,')]]/requirement[@name='RandomRoll']/@value">1</set>
  <!-- EN: Spring Heel must scale JumpStrength by percentage across all 100 ranks. The source uses base_add and reaches extreme physics values; merely lowering that base value still breaks when combined with Parkour or equipment.
